<title>JAPAN: Japan prosecutors raid DKB headquarters -- Jiji.</title>
<headline>Japan prosecutors raid DKB headquarters -- Jiji.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prosecutors have begun searching the headquarters of Dai-Ichi Kangyo Bank Ltd for evidence of suspected illegal payoffs to &quot;sokaiya&quot; corporate racketeers, Jiji news agency reported on Friday.</p>
</text>
